# The vendored design project. Everything here is a copy of the OpenDesign project
# `televim-app`, kept in step by `scripts/design-sync.sh` — so these are the paths
# a full copy of that project drags in and this repo does not want.
#
# OpenDesign's own undo store. It is an undo history, not a reviewable one, and the
# repository's git history is the record.
.file-versions/
# The skill OpenDesign installed for its own runs. Not ours to version.
.od-skills/
# OpenDesign's per-file metadata, written when it makes something an artifact.
*.artifact.json
